Order=65
Title=Screensavers
Body=There are 74 screensavers, in eight categories such as Space & Cosmos and Neon & Synthwave. They come in four families: classic 3D hacks, shader art, the Hyprsaver set, and in-house savers made for NCZ-OS, including Black Hole, Fractasia and Magmasimplex. Black Hole and Fractasia run on any graphics; Magmasimplex looks best on a stronger GPU, and the chooser picks settings to suit your machine.
